                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enormous (in size or impact)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a32f3672-ea99-4b5c-917d-3fde239cdf92",
                                                "sense_id": "37faa743-be34-3763-9c8b-69eb5b2c5f45",
                                                "text": "The policies and decisions to be made were neither very complex nor very numerous, since at that time, the needs and priorities in Germany did not involve issues of galactic impact, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07f5d9ef-d714-4630-818b-9b251acc2b8f",
                                                "sense_id": "37faa743-be34-3763-9c8b-69eb5b2c5f45",
                                                "text": "For a fashion journal, there is a more important and more difficult judgement to make: Is the work of such galactic significance as to be eligible to grace the pages of this magnificent journal?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bf017d1-0567-4fd9-ae93-5777fabdb098",
                                                "sense_id": "37faa743-be34-3763-9c8b-69eb5b2c5f45",
                                                "text": "“Yes, his heart is one of galactic proportions.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c61249ec-5f25-4c3b-b37e-fd56b6e9fd77",
                                                "sense_id": "37faa743-be34-3763-9c8b-69eb5b2c5f45",
                                                "text": "The credit crunch became a mess of galactic proportions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf69c62d-94fa-3ac7-8d0f-e8bb5b1ff70c",
                                        "entry_id": "00a6c385-db5f-31a3-b7f9-2f9b40a4dfde",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to milk, or the secretion of milk."
